  TAXICAB GEOMETRY IN TOURNAMENT SPACE
  opus-2026-03-25-S339
========================================================================

  1. THE π_p FUNCTION (circumference / diameter in Lp norm)
       p  π_p (intrinsic)  π_p (Euclidean) Unit ball area
       1         4.000000         2.828427       2.000000
     1.5         3.259768         2.969681       2.737854
